.* CMDSAVRST: Save and Restore Commands, a group of the major command menu.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDSAVRST'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDSAVRST HELP=HLPCMDSAVRST KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Save and Restore Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?SAVRST'.
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?SAVRSTCFG'.
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?SAVRSTCHG'.
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?SAVRSTDLO'.
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?SAVRSTLIB'.
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?SAVRSTOBJ'.
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Related Command Menus
:MENUI HELP='CMDSAVRST/OPT7' OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU CMDOBJMGT'.Object Management Commands  CMDOBJMGT
:MENUI HELP='CMDSAVRST/OPT8' OPTION=8 ACTION='MENU CMDOPC'.OptiConnect Commands  CMDOPC
:MENUI HELP='CMDSAVRST/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='MENU CMDRST'.Restore Commands  CMDRST
:MENUI HELP='CMDSAVRST/OPT10' OPTION=10 ACTION='MENU CMDSAV'.Save Commands  CMDSAV
:MENUI HELP='CMDSAVRST/OPT11' OPTION=11 ACTION='MENU CMDTAP'.Tape Commands  CMDTAP
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDSAVRST.Save and Restore Commands - Help
:P.Save and Restore Commands: the commands and the command menus of this
group, as the major command menu arranges them, with each name at the
right of its row. A blank row is a command this release does not
provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command or show the
menu, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous
menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command
groups.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows menu MAJOR.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSAVRST/OPT7'.Object Management Commands  CMDOBJMGT
:P.Option 7. Shows menu CMDOBJMGT&colon. Object Management Commands
CMDOBJMGT.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSAVRST/OPT8'.OptiConnect Commands  CMDOPC
:P.Option 8. Shows menu CMDOPC&colon. OptiConnect Commands CMDOPC.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSAVRST/OPT9'.Restore Commands  CMDRST
:P.Option 9. Shows menu CMDRST&colon. Restore Commands CMDRST.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSAVRST/OPT10'.Save Commands  CMDSAV
:P.Option 10. Shows menu CMDSAV&colon. Save Commands CMDSAV.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CMDSAVRST/OPT11'.Tape Commands  CMDTAP
:P.Option 11. Shows menu CMDTAP&colon. Tape Commands CMDTAP.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
